{
  "slug": "claudescrumskill",
  "name": "Claudescrumskill",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Complete scrum pipeline for GitHub — scaffolds a GitHub Project board with epics, stories, custom fields, and views directly from a PRD, then manages the full sprint lifecycle: planning, status tracking, and releases. Claude works stories autonomously via branching, PRs, and auto-merge to release branches while you review one PR per sprint. Includes full-project emulation testing that validates integration seams, layer contracts, and cross-service payload mismatches before ...",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `project-cleanup` (Systematically verify and enforce codebase hygiene — zero build errors, zero lint warnings, HATEOAS compliance, no dead or…), `project-emulate` (Systematically walk through every user-facing workflow in a project by reading the codebase, discovering all roles and functionality,…), `project-orchestrate` (Autonomous project lifecycle driver that ties together all skills into a continuous loop — plan sprints, execute stories…), `project-scaffold` (Scaffold a complete GitHub Project from PRD or spec documents, or add stories to an existing project and…), `project-spec` (Transform a rough prompt into a comprehensive specification document), `sprint-plan` (Plan the next sprint iteration for a GitHub Project), `sprint-release` (Wrap up a sprint by generating a release summary, opening release PRs for human review, handling incomplete stories,…), `sprint-status` (Generate a status report for the current sprint)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claudescrumskill@claude-community` from `houseofwolvesllc/claudescrumskill`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "House of Wolves LLC"
  },
